  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5702.02 Information Requested on FD-249 (Rev. 3-1-10).\n\n(a) The following information shall be included on FD-249 (Rev. 3-1-10):\n\n(1) Last name, first name, middle initial and suffix of person fingerprinted;\n\n(2) Signature of person fingerprinted;\n\n(3) Social security number;\n\n(4) Aliases or maiden names;\n\n(5) FBI number;\n\n(6) State identification number;\n\n(7) Date of birth;\n\n(8) Sex, race, height, weight, eye color, and hair color;\n\n(9) An indication as to the person fingerprinted is a juvenile and, if so, whether or not to treat as adult;\n\n(10) Date of arrest;\n\n(11) Place of birth;\n\n(12) Country of citizenship;\n\n(13) Notations regarding any scars, marks, tattoos, and amputations;\n\n(14) Fingerprints of each thumb and finger, taken under the authority of RSA 106-B:13 or 593:2;\n\n(15) The residence/complete address, including city and state;\n\n(16) The name or number of the official taking the fingerprints;\n\n(17) The local identification or reference;\n\n(18) An indication as to whether a photograph is available and whether palm prints are taken;\n\n(19) The employer and occupation;\n\n(20) The charge(s) or citation(s), including disposition;\n\n(21) Any additional information or basis for caution; and\n\n(22) The state bureau stamp.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5700) #6704, eff 3-3-98, EXPIRED: 3-3-06\n\nNew. #8591, INTERIM, eff 3-24-06, EXPIRES: 9-20-06; ss by #8651, eff 6-2-06, EXPIRED: 6-2-14\n\nNew. #11157, INTERIM, eff 8-18-16, EXPIRED: 2-14-17\n\nNew. #12132, eff 3-17-17",
